title: "dataset-fingerprint: a lockfile for training data"
abstract: >-
  Manifest-based dataset versioning with leakage-aware splits, lineage and
  integrity verification for any modality (vision, audio, sensors, text,
  time series) on any storage (local, S3, Azure, GCS, Databricks).
